<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/fbae0608813354e606a46a3752e6e8abb60d234a#test_adds_quotes_when_invalid_json> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/v0.25/core/text> "def test_adds_quotes_when_invalid_json(self):\n        tokens = list(self.lexer.tokenize('`{{}`'))\n        self.assertEqual(\n            tokens,\n            [{'type': 'literal', 'value': '{{}',\n              'start': 0, 'end': 4},\n             {'type': 'eof', 'value': '',\n              'start': 5, 'end': 5}\n             ]\n        )" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/fbae0608813354e606a46a3752e6e8abb60d234a> .
